MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial_en-US
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en-US
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ee314feb8021210499be4928396b27fb, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 5823308054528
    m_Localized: Before we start, it's essential to learn the basic controls and
      interactions. First, point to the "Continue" button at the bottom with one
      of your controllers and, whenever it's on, press the red trigger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6139642462208
    m_Localized: To move, use the joystick of your left controller. Try moving forward
      for a few meters. Then, go backwards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6309574688768
    m_Localized: Go around the class passing by the red spots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6407822065664
    m_Localized: It's time for your students to listen. Order the student to get
      out of the class. Once they're gone, tell them to sit down again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6539703566336
    m_Localized: Now, you must understand the buttons on your controllers. Look at
      them and press the buttons as they're turning red and pay attention to what
      they do. Press the red button on the right controller to activate the 'Pause'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1037787545600
    m_Localized: Buttons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12337074749440
    m_Localized: Now, you can't move. To resume the action, you must press the 'Pause'
      button again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16207708504064
    m_Localized: Close the 'Hand Menu' by clicking on 'Resume' or pressing the menu
      button again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5167079833600
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32399127035904
    m_Localized: Good morning, teacher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12458734731264
    m_Localized: Welcome to the Classroom VR Tutorial! Here you'll learn all you
      need to know to become an excellent teacher on our virtual classroom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14659683172352
    m_Localized: Activate the 'Hand Menu' by pressing on the 'Menu' button on your
      left controller.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11923948388352
    m_Localized: Now, walk backwards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 225451524096
    m_Localized: Movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 896590495744
    m_Localized: Orders
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136663404544
    m_Localized: Jump
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16319562203136
    m_Localized: Now order the student to go sit again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11245242892288
    m_Localized: Great! Let's go to the next step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11329611317248
    m_Localized: Now, we'll continue with the next step
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6693404672
    m_Localized: Welcome
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8734389911552
    m_Localized: You have passed the Tutorial!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 817523671040
    m_Localized: Objectives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
